        "retentionReason": "Approved decision graph-reading-working-page35 retains the original investment charts because the exact intermediate data and interest rate are unavailable. The inspected original Word asset contains both source charts and no supplied answers. Keeping the pair together preserves the left/right placement, differing plot heights, grids, markers and labels without inventing data. Raster pixels remain unchanged; occurrence-specific final-size typography, palette and marker-fill review remains required.",
        "spec": {
          "sourcePage": 35,
